## Discovery & promotion rules

- A new FR is added when a real product need surfaces and is agreed.
- An FR's priority may be promoted (e.g., S → M) via a roadmap edit; never demoted silently.
- Once shipped, an FR is marked `[x]` and remains in the table as historical record.
- An FR explicitly out-of-scope is marked `W` with a brief note.
